# The functions this step measures, one per line, in the order the harness
# is asked for them.  The file name carries the step number so that two steps
# can never collide in the Docker build context, where entries are keyed on
# (path, size, mtime) and never on content.
#
# Every line must be a function the harness knows and this step's reference
# implementation actually provides.  Derived from the oracle patch, not written
# by hand -- see this step's solution/oracle.patch.
bloom.sbbf.find
